spec: S03-02, S03-01, S03-15

Unsupported types and absolute / `file://` references warn and are ignored (the push succeeds
with no manifest entries — so no `assets:` line); URLs, `mailto:` and fragments are silent.

```console
$ annotary -p rowan push as-unsup.md
warning: unsupported asset notes.docx (.docx) — not uploaded, link left as written
warning: absolute path /srv/pics/x.png — ignored (not portable)
warning: absolute path file:///tmp/x.pdf — ignored (not portable)
as-unsup	[..]	v1

$ annotary -p rowan push as-unsup.md --json warnings
warning: unsupported asset notes.docx (.docx) — not uploaded, link left as written
warning: absolute path /srv/pics/x.png — ignored (not portable)
warning: absolute path file:///tmp/x.pdf — ignored (not portable)
{"warnings":["unsupported asset notes.docx (.docx) — not uploaded, link left as written","absolute path /srv/pics/x.png — ignored (not portable)","absolute path file:///tmp/x.pdf — ignored (not portable)"]}

$ annotary -p rowan pull as-unsup --out out --assets
pull: 0 threads, 0 assets
as-unsup.md	as-unsup.annotary	v1

```
